  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to support effective measures that provide justice and redress for massive human rights atrocities in various fragile states, and to promote the development of peaceful and stable societies.
The grant is a core contribution to the organisation&apos;s strategic plan 2013-2015. The primary areas of Work are: A) Thematic Initiatives (criminal justice, reparative justice, truth and memory, gender justice unit), B) Country level initiatives.</narrative>
